    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe mwana w'omuntu, ogambire omukama wa Tiro oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Orwo ogira eikuru, okeyeta ruhanga, nogamba okwo oshuntamire aha nketo ya baruhanga omu nyanja engundu, kandi okwo oli muntu, toli ruhanga n'orwo olikutekeleza kuba mumanyi nka ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ego, isi omu mazima oli mumanyi kushaga Danieli; taliho nama eshelekire ahali iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obumanyi bwawe n'akalyo kawe bikubonesize eitunga, wahiga ezahabu n'efeza wabiteka omu sitoa zawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obumanyi bwawe bungi omu kutunda bukubonesize eitunga elishagireho, kyonkai eitunga lyawe lyakugiza eikuru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orw'ekyo inye Ruhanga Omukama ningamba nti: Orwo olikwelenga kuba mumanyi nka ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leba, ndakubunza abanyamahanga, eihanga elilikutinisa kushaga amahanga gona. Baraihya embanda zabo omu biraro byazo baite ebintu byawe ebirungi eby'obonesize akalyo n'obumanyi, obumanyi bwawe obw'oyeta burungi babwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barakujugunya Sheoli, bakwitire omu nyanja engundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oraba okyagambira abakwisire okw'oli ruhanga, n'orwo oli muntu, otali ruhanga, oli omu mikono yabo nibakwita? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oraitwa abanyamahanga, ofe orufu orw'abatatahiriirwe. Ayagamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Omukama angambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w'omuntu, ochulire omukama wa Tiro, omugambire oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Wabaga bulebero bw'obugorogoki, okaba oina obumanyi bungi muno, oli murungi ohikilire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waturaga Edeni omu ndimiro ya Ruhanga. Buli ibare ly'eiguzi walijwaraga, nka sarudio, samaragido, ealumasi, beruro, onikisi, sarudio, karubunko, n'ezahabu. Emilengyo yawe yabaga y'ezahabu. Bikakorwa aha rwawe kiro kyowatondwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkataho omukerubi enkorwamajuta kukulinda; waturaga aha Ibanga litakatifu lya Ruhanga; warabaga omu mabare g'omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu byowakoraga wabaga nyakatetere kwema kiro ekyo watonzirwe, kuhika orwo wamanyire kufakara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watundaga ebintu bingi muno, kyonkai wanyagaga abantu, ofakara. Kityo nkakuchwa aha Ibanga lya Ruhanga okw'obona ekintu ekihagaire, n'omukerubi omulinzi wawe yakubinga omu mabare g'omuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburungi bwawe bukakugiza eikuru; obumanyi bwawe wabwita aha rw'obushemere bwawe. Nkakukuntura ahansi nakutarangya omu maisho g'abakama kabakutangalira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyanya yawe emitakatifu okagihagaza aha rw'entambara zawe ezingi muno, n'emitundire yawe etaina mazima. Nikyo nakwokeize, omuliro gukakwokya, wahya wagoba aha itaka, wasigara eijwi, nikwo abantu bona bakuboine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga gona agakumanya nigakutangalira. Osilikire kubi, mara tolibaho rundi eirai lyona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe mwana w'omuntu, ta amaisho ahali Sidoni orange ebilikwija kugibaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogambe oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Iwe Sidoni, leba nkunokeire, mara ninyija kubonesa ekitinwa kyange omuli iwe. Nyije nkubonabonyie, nyeyolekye okwo mba mutakatifu, baije bamanye okwo mba Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakuteza endwara, n'abantu mbaitire omu mbarabara, abalikukuturamu mbaite, mbaise embanda ekutangatangire buli rubaju. Aho baramanya okwo mba Mukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagamba ati, “Talibaho rukwatango rulishuba kuchumita ihanga lya Isiraeli, nangu n'eihwa ly'okubahutaza chei omuli batabani babo ababaire nibabajangura. Aho baramanya okwo mba Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga akagamba ati, “Orwo ndashomboza eihanga lya Isiraeli omu mahanga ago bemaliremu, nkema omuli bonene nkoleka amahanga okwo mba mutakatifu, aho Abaisiraeli abo baratura omu nsi eyabo eyo nahaire omwiru wange Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baligituramu omu milembe, bombeke amaju, balime n'endimiro z'emizabibu. Balitura omu milembe, orwo ndibonabonyia batabani babo, abatura nibabajangura. Ahanyuma balimanya okwo mba Mukama Ruhanga wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.28.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
